values ('f6a7b8c9-0d1e-4f12-9a12-2b3c4d5e6f32', 'digital-and-social-media-journalism', 'Digital and Social Media Journalism', 'A newsroom-style course in digital and social media journalism. Students learn to write for the web, optimize accurate journalism for discovery, report and verify social content, engage communities, interpret analytics, produce live coverage, build newsletters and podcasts, handle user-generated content, counter misinformation, use digital storytelling tools, and evaluate algorithmic and AI-mediated publishing environments. The course emphasizes verification, public service, accessibility, audience trust, ethical distribution, and publishable portfolio work.');

